Subject: [PATCH 15/17] fix(a11y): bind page actions and reviews to current
 evidence

LT-117, LT-109: share stored-target page actions and invalidate before possible writes.
Reject delayed pre-write scan evidence and reset the mounted reviewer form when its
fingerprint or scope changes.

